title: 'snowbridge: restore unchecked sync committee key parsing'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Restore unchecked deserialization for authenticated Ethereum sync committee public keys.
    Repeating the G1 subgroup check for all 512 keys makes committee-update calls exceed the
    synchronous Bridge Hub block budget and stalls Snowbridge at committee rotation.
crates:
- name: snowbridge-beacon-primitives
  bump: patch
- name: bridge-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
